### BookStore API - HTTP Request Examples
### VS Code REST Client / JetBrains HTTP Client

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5004
@adminToken = {{adminLogin.response.body.token}}
@editorToken = {{editorRegister.response.body.token}}

### ============================
### Authentication
### ============================

### Login with the seeded development Admin
# @name adminLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@bookstore.com",
  "password": "Admin@123"
}

### Public registration always creates an Editor
# @name editorRegister
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "editor@bookstore.com",
  "password": "Editor@123",
  "name": "Editor User",
  "role": 0
}

### The response above must report role = "Editor" even though role=0 (Admin) was requested.

### ============================
### Categories
### ============================

### List categories as Admin
GET {{baseUrl}}/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Get category by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/categories/1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Create category (Admin only)
POST {{baseUrl}}/categories
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
  "name": "Philosophy",
  "description": "Philosophy and ethics books"
}

### Editor cannot create category — expected 403
POST {{baseUrl}}/categories
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{editorToken}}

{
  "name": "Unauthorized Category",
  "description": "This request should be forbidden"
}

### ============================
### Books
### ============================

### List books
GET {{baseUrl}}/books?page=1&pageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Filter by title
GET {{baseUrl}}/books?title=clean
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Filter by author
GET {{baseUrl}}/books?author=martin
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Get book by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/books/1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Create book as Editor — allowed
POST {{baseUrl}}/books
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{editorToken}}

{
  "title": "Design Patterns",
  "author": "Gang of Four",
  "isbn": "9780201633610",
  "year": 1994,
  "price": 44.99,
  "stock": 8,
  "categoryId": 2
}

### Update book (Admin only)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/books/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
  "title": "Clean Code: A Handbook of Agile Software Craftsmanship",
  "author": "Robert C. Martin",
  "isbn": "9780132350884",
  "year": 2008,
  "price": 42.99,
  "stock": 20,
  "categoryId": 2
}

### ============================
### Users — Admin only
### ============================

GET {{baseUrl}}/users
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Editor access — expected 403
GET {{baseUrl}}/users
Authorization: Bearer {{editorToken}}
